#. type: Title-text
#: ../scene.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Massacre"
msgstr "Massacro"

#. type: Resume-text
#: ../scene.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use a loop in order to destroy six targets."
msgstr "Usa un ciclo per distruggere sei bersagli."

#. type: ScriptName-text
#: ../scene.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Go"
msgstr "Go"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exercise"
msgstr "Esercizio"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Destroy the six <a object|bottarg>targets</a> with a program using a loop. "
"The bot must move 5m forward to get from one target to the next."
msgstr ""
"Distruggi i sei <a object|bottarg>bersagli</a> con un ciclo. Avanza di 5 m "
"per passare da uno all’altro."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "General principle"
msgstr "Principio generale"

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "move 5m forward"
msgstr "avanza di 5 m"

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "turn 90 degrees left"
msgstr "gira di 90 gradi a sinistra"

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "shoot"
msgstr "spara"

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "turn 90 degrees right"
msgstr "gira di 90 gradi a destra"

#. type: Image filename
#: ../help/help.E.txt:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "tfor1"
msgstr "tfor1"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instruction <code>for ( )</code>"
msgstr "Istruzione <code>for ( )</code>"

#. type: Bullet: '1)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Initialize the counting variable."
msgstr "Inizializza il contatore."

#. type: Bullet: '2)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "The end <a cbot|cond>condition</a>."
msgstr "La <a cbot|cond>condizione</a> di fine."

#. type: Bullet: '3)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "The counting <a cbot|expr>expression</a>."
msgstr "L’<a cbot|expr>espressione</a> di conteggio."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here is the loop once it is integrated into the program frame:"
msgstr "Ecco il ciclo nello scheletro del programma:"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<c/>extern void object::Massacre( )\n"
"{\n"
"\tfor ( int i=0 ; i<6 ; i=i+1 )\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t<n/>instructions repeated 6 times ...<c/>\n"
"\t}\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"<c/>extern void object::Massacre( )\n"
"{\n"
"\tfor ( int i=0 ; i<6 ; i=i+1 )\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t<n/>instructions repeated 6 times ...<c/>\n"
"\t}\n"
"}"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ATTENTION: The line <code>for ( )</code> must not be followed by a <a "
"cbot|term>semicolon</a> !"
msgstr ""
"ATTENZIONE: dopo <code>for ( )</code> non inserire un <a cbot|term>punto e "
"virgola</a>!"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Explanation of the instruction <code>for ( )</code>"
msgstr "Spiegazione di <code>for ( )</code>"

#. type: Bullet: '1)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "<code>int i=0</code>"
msgstr "<code>int i=0</code>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    The <a cbot|var>variable</a> i is set to zero before the beginning of "
"the loop."
msgstr "    La <a cbot|var>variabile</a> i viene azzerata prima del ciclo."

#. type: Bullet: '2)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "<code>i<6</code>"
msgstr "<code>i<6</code>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "    The loop will be executed as long as i is smaller than 6."
msgstr "    Il ciclo continua finché i è minore di 6."

#. type: Bullet: '3)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "<code>i=i+1</code>"
msgstr "<code>i=i+1</code>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "    At the end of every loop, add 1 to the variable i."
msgstr "    Alla fine di ogni iterazione aggiungi 1 a i."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Blocks"
msgstr "Blocchi"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:41
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use braces <code>{ }</code> in order to create a <a cbot|bloc>block</a>. All"
" the instructions that must be executed in the <code>for</code> loop are "
"held together by a block. The whole program itself is made up of a block:"
msgstr ""
"Usa le graffe <code>{ }</code> per creare un <a cbot|bloc>blocco</a> con le "
"istruzioni del ciclo <code>for</code>. Anche l’intero programma è un blocco:"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:43
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"extern void object::massacre( )\n"
"{\n"
"\t<n/>fill in here ...<c/>\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"extern void object::massacre( )\n"
"{\n"
"\t<n/>fill in here ...<c/>\n"
"}"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:48
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Never change these characters. Just add the instructions of the program between the braces.\n"
"You can fit several blocks one into the other. For example the <code>for</code> block is fitted into the block of the whole program. In order to improve readability, the editor lines up the braces belonging to the different blocks."
msgstr ""
"Non modificare questi caratteri: inserisci le istruzioni fra le graffe.\n"
"I blocchi possono essere annidati: per esempio quello del <code>for</code> è dentro il programma. L’editor allinea le graffe per migliorarne la leggibilità."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remember"
msgstr "Ricorda"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:52
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The instruction used to move forward is <c/><a cbot|move>move</a>();<n/>.\n"
"The instruction used to turn the bot is <c/><a cbot|turn>turn</a>();<n/>. A positive angle turns left.\n"
"The instruction used to fire the cannon is <c/><a cbot|fire>fire</a>(1);<n/>. A one-second burst allows to destroy all six <a object|bottarg>targets</a>."
msgstr ""
"Per avanzare usa <c/><a cbot|move>move</a>();<n/>.\n"
"Per ruotare usa <c/><a cbot|turn>turn</a>();<n/>; positivo gira a sinistra.\n"
"Per sparare usa <c/><a cbot|fire>fire</a>(1);<n/>. Una raffica di un secondo basta a distruggere i sei <a object|bottarg>bersagli</a>."

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "See also"
msgstr "Vedi anche"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:57
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<a cbot>Programming</a>, <a cbot|type>types</a> and <a "
"cbot|category>categories</a>."
msgstr ""
"<a cbot>Programmazione</a>, <a cbot|type>tipi</a> e <a "
"cbot|category>categorie</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The program must execute the following scheme:\n"
"Repeat 6 times :"
msgstr ""
"Il programma deve seguire questo schema:\n"
"Ripeti 6 volte:"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The instruction <code><a cbot|for>for</a></code> asks for 3 expressions:"
msgstr "<code><a cbot|for>for</a></code> richiede 3 espressioni:"
